 null, 'Enzymes are biological catalysts that are, with rare exceptions (like ribozymes), proteins whose specific 3D structure enables substrate binding and catalysis.'),
('NEET UG', 'Chemistry', 'Biomolecules and Environmental Chemistry', 'medium', 'mcq',
 'The ozone layer in the stratosphere primarily absorbs which type of radiation, protecting life on Earth?',
 '[{"text":"Infrared radiation","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Ultraviolet radiation","isCorrect":true},{"text":"Visible light","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Radio waves","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb,
 null, 'The ozone layer absorbs most of the sun''s harmful ultraviolet radiation, preventing it from reaching the Earth''s surface in damaging amounts.'),
('NEET UG', 'Chemistry', 'Biomolecules and Environmental Chemistry', 'medium', 'mcq',
 'Which greenhouse gas is the largest overall contributor to global warming by volume of emissions?',
 '[{"text":"Carbon dioxide","isCorrect":true},{"text":"Methane","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Ozone","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Nitrous oxide","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb,
